  m_text: 'Welcome is an airplane game and there are airplanes

    Like to fly?
    Hmm, well then this is the game for you

    Do you like bombing ships over the
    sea? hmm this is weird

    Do you like different difficulties and Competitions?
    Oh yes then this is for you!

    Press the play button and start dodging homing
    missiles otherwise you will explode over the sea in less than 5 seconds

    Good
    luck)'
